fn KHF_NValidModObj i aa=      -----不允许添加指定修改器的条件检测函数,参数:1.i传入当前对象；2.aa,传入指定修改器;   这里应该考虑不到组头的关系,因为组的嵌套关系太复杂了,
((superClassOf i==shape and findItem KGL_ProxyXRefID(i.classid as string)==0 and not i.baseobject.render_renderable)or findItem KGL_ProxyXRefID(i.classid as string)!=0 or(not(validModifier i aa)and not isGroupHead i))
(DotNetClass "System.Windows.Forms.Application").CurrentCulture = dotnetObject "System.Globalization.CultureInfo" "zh-cn"           ----切换语言区域性,保证NET支持中文字符的问题,
