on KC_CBk2 changed a do KC_CBA2.state=KC_CBB2.state=KC_CBC2.state=KC_La6=a
on KC_CBk3 changed a do KC_CBA3.state=KC_CBB3.state=KC_CBC3.state=KC_La7=a
