else messageBox "填充阵列命令在必须有两个初选对象的情况下才能调用!" title:"填充阵列操作提示--阿酷提示"))
fn lcl_Instan_Unique=
(if (KL_JianCLigObj aaa:1 bbb:3 ccc:2) do(
undo on(
lcl_Instance=#()
for oo in selection do
(if (InstanceMgr.GetInstances oo &jjjjj)>1 do for hhhh in jjjjj where (findItem lcl_Instance hhhh)==0 do append lcl_Instance hhhh)
if lcl_Instance.count>0 do(
kugeINtrue=yesNoCancelBox"请选择操作形式:\n是:整体断开(选择内部之间保持).\n否:单个断开(选择内部之间不保持).\n取消:退出操作!"title:"断开选择与未选择对象之间的关联--阿酷提示"
if kugeINtrue==#yes do InstanceMgr.MakeObjectsUnique selection #group
if kugeINtrue==#no do InstanceMgr.MakeObjectsUnique selection #individual))))
fn lcl_Instan_Establish=
(if (KL_JianCLigObj aaa:1 bbb:3 ccc:2) do(
local KL_lcl2,lcl1,lcl3
InstanceMgr.MakeObjectsUnique selection #group            
KL_lcl2=getCurrentSelection()   
setCommandPanelTaskMode mode:#create     
if KL_lcl2.count>0 do
(lcl1=pickObject message:"点击关联到目标对象:"        
if lcl1!=undefined do(thawSelection()
clearSelection()                           
lcl3=for i in KL_lcl2 where((getPolygonCount i)as string==(getPolygonCount lcl1)as string)and(i.classid as string==lcl1.classid as string)and(not i.isTarget)collect i   
if lcl3.count!=KL_lcl2.count 
then(a4=yesNoCancelBox "选择中含有与目标对象不同的物体:\nYes:关联所有选择!\nNo:仅关联相同的物体!\nCencel:退出操作!" title:"建立对象关联警告--阿酷提示" 
if a4!=#cancel and a4!=undefined do(if a4==#yes then(instanceReplace KL_lcl2 lcl1
try(for t in KL_lcl2 do(t.material=lcl1.material
t.wireColor=lcl1.wireColor
t.scale=lcl1.scale
t.objectOffsetScale=lcl1.objectOffsetScale))catch()
select KL_lcl2)                                     
else(instanceReplace lcl3 lcl1
try(for t in lcl3 do(t.material=lcl1.material
t.wireColor=lcl1.wireColor
t.scale=lcl1.scale
t.objectOffsetScale=lcl1.objectOffsetScale))catch()
select lcl3)))
else (instanceReplace KL_lcl2 lcl1
try(for t in KL_lcl2 do(t.material=lcl1.material
t.wireColor=lcl1.wireColor
t.scale=lcl1.scale
t.objectOffsetScale=lcl1.objectOffsetScale))catch()
select KL_lcl2)))
setCommandPanelTaskMode mode:#modify))
fn KF_Scene_DelBacke abcd bb=
(convertToMesh abcd
DelBakFnum=0
progressStart ("选择对象减背面处理:")
KL_MMMMMB10=abcd.count
for i=1 to KL_MMMMMB10 do(KL_B1=abcd[i].numfaces
KL_DelFae=#() 
for ff=1 to KL_B1 do(KL_Va=in coordsys (Inverse(getViewTM())) getFaceNormal abcd[i] ff         
if KL_Va.z<-0.25 do append KL_DelFae ff)
DelBakFnum+=KL_DelFae.count
meshop.deleteFaces abcd[i] KL_DelFae delIsoVerts:true
progressUpdate (100.0*i/KL_MMMMMB10))
progressEnd()
if bb do select abcd
completeRedraw()
return DelBakFnum)
fn KF_Scene_DelBacke_fna=
(if (KL_JianCLigObj aaa:1 bbb:3 ccc:2) do(
if selection.count>0 do 
(if not(viewport.getType()==#view_camera or viewport.getType()==#view_persp_user) then
(Kl_DBA11=for i in selection where ViewgeoFilt i and canConvertTo i Mesh collect i   
if Kl_DBA11.count>0 do
(thawSelection()
clearSelection() 
undo on(Kl_bbb=KF_Scene_DelBacke Kl_DBA11 true
gc light:true)
displayTempPrompt ("当前选择对象共删减"+(Kl_bbb as string)+"个面") 12000))
else messageBox "这个命令不能使用在相机视图或透视图!" title:"删除背面命令警告--阿酷提示")))
fn lcl_Scene_DetchBynum=							 
(if (KL_JianCLigObj aaa:1 bbb:3 ccc:2) do(
kuge3dsnumGG=((getINISetting (getMAXIniFile()) "akoo2009" "CollapseFaceLimit") as number)
kugeAAA=getCurrentSelection()
kugewwwff11=#()
kugeExpobj=for i in objects where kugegeoFilt i and (getPolygonCount i)[2]>=kuge3dsnumGG collect i 
if kugeExpobj.count>0 then
(KUGE_Q1=queryBox "继续操作之前请确认是否备份好文件！\n点击“是”继续操作；点击“否”先退出。" title:"场景按面数分离警告--阿酷提示"
if KUGE_Q1 do undo off
(thawSelection()
clearSelection()
kl_ppp=kugeExpobj.count
progressStart ("按面数["+(kuge3dsnumGG as string)+"]拆分对象操作("+(kl_ppp as string)+"个对象):")
KL_UUU1=0
KL_UUU2=0
for kk=1 to kl_ppp do
(kugecolor11=kugeExpobj[kk].wireColor
kugegrn11=kugeExpobj[kk].name 
kugemat11=kugeExpobj[kk].material                     
kugeExpa=snapshotAsMesh kugeExpobj[kk]
kugjtem=kugeExpa.numfaces
while kugeExpa.numfaces>0 do
(progressUpdate (100.0*(kugjtem-kugeExpa.numfaces)/kugjtem)
KL_UUU1+=1
